{"name": "SpongeBob SquarePants: Titans of the Tide", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479650/extras/881cccb2e8520d9731b91b101fa19130.webp?t=1770127075\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479650/extras/afec709d1c78878a20397057924bcdad.poster.avif?t=1770127075\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479650/extras/afec709d1c78878a20397057924bcdad.webm?t=1770127075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479650/extras/afec709d1c78878a20397057924bcdad.mp4?t=1770127075\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>How do you stop the two biggest egos of the Seven Seas from fighting? A clash between the Flying Dutchman and King Neptune has unleashed ghostly mayhem all over Bikini Bottom. SpongeBob and Patrick will need all their skills, bravery and - dare I say - wit, to return life to what passes for normal in their undersea home. Join Bikini Bottom's most notorious duo on their ghostliest adventure yet!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479650/extras/a49580491765bc3c1149ae72a0f97eb7.webp?t=1770127075\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autopla